CHARACTERS AND NUMBERS CANNOT BE JOINED WITH A COMMA: THAT
IS A DOMAIN ERROR. TO PRINT THEM ON ONE LINE, SEPARATE THEM
WITH SEMICOLONS. TRY:

      'TOTAL: ';+/1 2 3
      'X IS ';5;' AND Y IS ';6

THIS IS MIXED OUTPUT, AND IT IS HOW THIS COURSE PRINTS YOUR
SCORE.

